### Inlet metal angle

`camberline.inlet_metal_angle_deg` · GUI section 02 · axial reference

Signed inlet tangent angle measured from downstream meridional direction.

**Illustrative range:** Baseline minus 5 and 2.5 degrees, the baseline, and baseline plus 5 degrees.

