### Turning concentration

`camberline.turning_concentration` · GUI section 02 · axial reference

Concentrate the tangent change around the turning location.

**Illustrative range:** 90%, 95%, 100% and 110% of the preset concentration, all above the minimum of one.

**Admissible inputs:** >= 1; coupled geometry checks also apply. These are mathematical bounds, not aerodynamic design limits or slider endpoints.

